  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Calculator</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Calc</h1>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"left\">Left</label>\n      <input id=\"left\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"0\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"right\">Right</label>\n      <input id=\"right\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"0\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"operation\">Operation</label>\n      <select id=\"operation\">\n        <option value=\"add\">Add (+)</option>\n        <option value=\"subtract\">Subtract (−)</option>\n        <option value=\"multiply\">Multiply (×)</option>\n        <option value=\"divide\">Divide (÷)</option>\n      </select>\n    </div>\n    <button id=\"calculate\" type=\"button\">Calculate</button>\n    <output id=\"result\" for=\"left right operation\">0</output>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1c2c;\n  --card: #29366f;\n  --accent: #41a6f6;\n  --text: #f4f4f4;\n  --error: #ef7d57;\n}\n\n* { box-sizing: border-box; }\n\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  padding: 24px 20px;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 360px;\n  border: 4px solid var(--accent);\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 #0f1020;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 16px;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  margin: 0 0 8px;\n  font-size: 24px;\n  text-align: center;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.field {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 6px;\n}\n\nlabel {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\ninput, select, button {\n  font: inherit;\n  padding: 10px 12px;\n  border: 3px solid var(--accent);\n  background: #0f1020;\n  color: var(--text);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  outline: none;\n}\n\ninput:focus, select:focus, button:focus-visible {\n  border-color: var(--text);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--accent);\n}\n\nbutton {\n  cursor: pointer;\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: #0f1020;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  transition: transform 0.05s ease;\n}\n\nbutton:hover { background: #6cc0ff; }\nbutton:active { transform: translate(2px, 2px); box-shadow: none; }\n\noutput {\n  display: block;\n  text-align: center;\n  font-size: 28px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  padding: 12px;\n  background: #0f1020;\n  border: 3px solid var(--accent);\n  word-break: break-all;\n}\n\noutput.error { color: var(--error); }\n\n@media (max-width: 360px) {\n  .card { padding: 16px 12px; }\n  h1 { font-size: 20px; }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "const leftInput = document.getElementById('left');\nconst rightInput = document.getElementById('right');\nconst operationSelect = document.getElementById('operation');\nconst calculateBtn = document.getElementById('calculate');\nconst resultOutput = document.getElementById('result');\n\nfunction parseNumber(value) {\n  if (value.trim() === '') return null;\n  const num = Number(value);\n  return Number.isFinite(num) ? num : null;\n}\n\nfunction compute() {\n  const left = parseNumber(leftInput.value);\n  const right = parseNumber(rightInput.value);\n  const op = operationSelect.value;\n\n  if (left === null || right === null) {\n    showError();\n    return;\n  }\n\n  let result;\n  switch (op) {\n    case 'add': result = left + right; break;\n    case 'subtract': result = left - right; break;\n    case 'multiply': result = left * right; break;\n    case 'divide':\n      if (right === 0) { showError(); return; }\n      result = left / right;\n      break;\n    default: showError(); return;\n  }\n\n  if (!Number.isFinite(result)) {\n    showError();\n    return;\n  }\n\n  resultOutput.textContent = String(result);\n  resultOutput.classList.remove('error');\n}\n\nfunction showError() {\n  resultOutput.textContent = 'Error';\n  resultOutput.classList.add('error');\n}\n\ncalculateBtn.addEventListener('click', compute);\n\n[leftInput, rightInput, operationSelect].forEach(el => {\n  el.addEventListener('keydown', e => {\n    if (e.key === 'Enter') compute();\n  });\n});",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Two-Number Calculator\n\nAn offline, dependency-free pixel-style calculator built with plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Enter two numbers in the **Left** and **Right** fields (negative values supported).\n3. Choose an operation: **Add**, **Subtract**, **Multiply**, or **Divide**.\n4. Click **Calculate** (or press Enter in any field).\n5. The result appears in the output box, initially showing `0`.\n\n## Operations\n\n- `add` — left + right\n- `subtract` — left − right\n- `multiply` — left × right\n- `divide` — left ÷ right\n\n## Error Behavior\n\nThe output shows exactly `Error` (no label) when:\n\n- Either input is empty or not a finite number (e.g., `abc`, `Infinity`, `1e999`).\n- Division by zero is attempted.\n- The computed result is not finite.\n\n## Accessibility\n\nAll controls have visible labels and are keyboard-accessible. Focus states are clearly visible.\n\n## Constraints\n\n- No packages, imports, network requests, storage, or external assets.\n- Uses relative paths only.\n- Under 200 total lines of code.",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
